            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>[Column A] To [Imperator Caesar Lucius Septimius] Severus Pertinax [Augustus] Arabicus Adibenicus Parthicus Maximus, pontifex maximus, with tribunician power [for the 10th time], consul for the third time, father of the fatherland.
                   [Column B] To [Imperator Caesar Marcus] Aurelius [Antoninus] Augustus Pius Felix [pontifex] maximus, with tribunician power for the [?] time [---]
                   [Footer] The people of Veii devoted [this] to their numen and majesty.
                </p>
